# Contents

This repository contains the data, code, and notebook associated with the text analysis of a Lens.org query relating to the terms "generative AI" and "genAI." The analysis is mainly focused on the abstract field associated with 1,000 scholarly articles that were queried using these terms.

- Final_Project.ipynb contains the Jupyter notebook used to perform the text analysis.
- lens_export_FP.csv contains the dataset used in the analysis.
- topic_words.csv displays the top ten words for each topic discovered using topic modeling.
- topics visualization.png displays these topics with their top 10 words in descending order of probability.
- classification_results.csv displays the predictions made with the machine learning model in CSV format.
- adaboost confusion matrix.png displays the confusion matrix of the model produced using the AdaBoost classifier.
- confusion_matrix.csv displays the AdaBoost confusion matrix in CSV format.
